    "long_instructions": "## Alan Turing\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1. Open each panel to learn about Alan Turing’s work and impact.\r\n2. Use the information to complete your AI Contributor Profile.\r\n3. Use the numbered sources below if you need more details.\r\n\r\n### Sources\r\n\r\n1. [Britannica — Alan Turing](https://www.britannica.com/biography/Alan-Turing)\r\n2. [HISTORY — Alan Turing](https://www.history.com/articles/alan-turing)",
